<title>SOUTH KOREA: SKorea denies report of Kia takeover by state bank.</title>
<headline>SKorea denies report of Kia takeover by state bank.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Finance Ministry on Tuesday denied a news report that the government was considering seeking court protection for Kia Motors Corp and then allowing a state-run bank to take it over, a ministry spokesman said.</p>
</text>
